  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are skilled at wielding an unusual weapon with ease, allowing you to utilize it in combat more effectively.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +1</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Select a single weapon from either the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Melee)\" title=\"Exotic Weapons (Melee)\">Exotic Weapons (Melee)</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Ranged)\" title=\"Exotic Weapons (Ranged)\">Exotic Weapons (Ranged)</a> weapon groups; you make attack rolls with the selected weapon without penalty.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> A character who uses a weapon without being proficient with it takes a -5 penalty to attack rolls.</p><p><b>Special:</b> You can gain this Feat multiple times. Each time you take this Feat, it applies to a different <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon\">Exotic Weapon</a>.</p>",
